    "notes": "Silent video with no text at all: every amount, the water for the rice, the cooking times and the heat are my guesses. Salt is never shown (added to taste in the spinach step). The red puree looks like tomato puree (could be chilli paste). The video cooks on an induction hob; gas works the same. The tall cup also seems to hold a little green chilli with the spinach. Rice pack brand is cropped out."
